OL,3,GNEWSAStolen cash machine recovered from
OL,4,Afield
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cash machine stolen from a shop has
OL,7,Fbeen recovered from a field in a
OL,8,Fneighbouring county.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police believes a group
OL,11,Fof men rammed the Co-op store in Bodmin
OL,12,FPlace, Broughton, Milton Keynes, at
OL,13,Fabout 04:45 BST on Thursday.
OL,15,FThe cash machine was later found in
OL,16,FWestoning, Bedfordshire.
OL,18,FThe force appealed for witnesses and
OL,19,Fsaid there was no wider threat to the
OL,20,Fpublic.
